<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43204" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑτερό-ρροπος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>inclined to one side</i>,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ κλῖμαξ ἑ. ἐπὶ γῆν
			ἀφίξεται</span> will come down <i>on one corner,
			unevenly</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Art.</u>
				43
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑ. ἐπάρματα</span> swellings
				<i>on one side</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				1.1
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλεγμοναί</span> ibid.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἑ.</span>, of crippled limbs, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Off.</u>
				23
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>inclining to one side or the other</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεῶν ἑ. δῶρα</span> gifts <i>that may prove either good
				or evil</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Rhian.
				1.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Adv. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πως</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				4.172
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				8.430
			</span></i>, Aspasia ap.<i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				16.72
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
